{"product_id":"the-things-that-will-not-stand","title":"The Things That Will Not Stand","description":"\u003cp\u003eSebastian Is At A University Open Day With His Best Friend Tolly When He Meets A Girl. Her Name Is Frida, And Shes Edgy, Caustic And Funny. Shes Also A Storyteller, But The Stories She Tells About Herself Dont Ring True, And As Their Surprising And Eventful Day Together Unfolds, Sebastian Struggles To Sort The Fact From The Fiction. But How Much Can He Expect Frida To Share In Just One Day? And How Much Of His Own Self And His Own Secrets Will He Be Willing To Reveal In Return?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 137 x 209\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Gerard Bauer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781742997582\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45169636901017,"sku":"3RE9781742997582","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67b9aa4411c61_The_20Things_20That_20Will_20Not_20Stand_20Michael_20Gerard_20Bauer.jpg?v=1740232439","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-things-that-will-not-stand","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}